cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SURF-ETDS measurement data"
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Tim
    family-names: Buck
    affiliation: "Medical University of Innsbruck"
  # Further contributors are listed in CONTRIBUTORS.md.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-data"
abstract: >-
  Raw measurement data of the SURF Test Unit, a three-degree-of-freedom motion
  phantom with two heated pads, recorded together with the tracking exports of a
  surface-guided radiotherapy system (ExacTrac Dynamic Surface) at the linear
  accelerators of Tirol Kliniken. One folder per measurement day and linac holds
  the phantom telemetry, the tracking exports, the run index and, where one was
  written, the measurement protocol. Operators are recorded as role codes.
keywords:
  - radiotherapy
  - surface-guided radiotherapy
  - SGRT
  - quality assurance
  - motion phantom
  - medical physics
  - dataset
# The measurement data and documentation are CC-BY-4.0; the scripts in tools/ are MIT.
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-data/blob/main/README.md#licence"
version: "1.0.0"
references:
  - type: software
    title: "SURF Test Unit: a low-cost 3-DOF motion phantom for surface-guidance QA"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-phantom"
    notes: >-
      Firmware, measurement terminal and hardware of the phantom that recorded the
      telemetry in this dataset; its data dictionary describes the file formats.
  - type: software
    title: "SURF ETD analysis pipeline"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-analysis"
    notes: >-
      Characterisation and validation of the tracking accuracy; evaluates campaign
      2026-03-10_L4.
  - type: software
    title: "SURF ETDS yearly QA"
    authors:
      - given-names: Tim
        family-names: Buck
    repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-qa"
    notes: >-
      Yearly quality assurance across linacs and report generation; evaluates the
      campaigns 2026-07-15_L1, 2026-07-29_L0, 2026-08-06_L3 and 2026-08-06_L4.
